									<p class="metasyncPara">The South Florida (USF) Bulls, despite an inconsistent historical performance, have shown signs of a turnaround with enhanced coaching strategies and refined recruitment methods. Their best NCAA run came in 2012 when they reached the Round of 32, and continued investment in facilities has slowly elevated their game.</p>								</div>
